<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Fairfax says appoints directors.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Fairfax says appoints directors.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newspaper publisher John Fairfax Holdings Ltd said on Monday that chief executive Robert Muscat and chief financial officer John Greaves were appointed directors of the company as of September 6.</p>
<p>Former chief executive Stephen Mulholland resigned as a director of the company as from the same date, it said.</p>
<p>The key Fairfax publications are The Sydney Morning Herald, Melbourne's The Age, and Australian Financial Review daily newspapers.</p>
